{
  "name": "Turn a website section into an Elementor template with MiroMiro",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Turn a website section into an Elementor template\nPick a website and a section in **Settings**: `hero`, `header`, `features`, `pricing`, `testimonials`, `faq`, `cta` or `footer`.\n\nDownload the .json from **Save the template**, then in WordPress: *Templates > Saved Templates > Import Templates*. 25 credits.\n\n**Setup (1 minute)**\n1. Get a free MiroMiro API key (300 credits a month, no card): https://miromiro.app/api/onboarding\n2. Open any MiroMiro node > Credential > Create new, paste the key.\n3. Change the website in **Settings**, then click **Execute workflow**.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "run",
      "name": "Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "settings",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -200,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "s0",
              "name": "website",
              "value": "https://stripe.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s1",
              "name": "section",
              "value": "hero",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "name": "Turn the section into Elementor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-miromiro.miroMiro",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        20,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "miroMiroApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "MiroMiro API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "website",
        "operation": "code",
        "url": "={{ $json.website }}",
        "framework": "elementor",
        "section": "={{ $json.section }}",
        "codeOptions": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "name": "Save the template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toText",
        "sourceProperty": "code",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "={{ String($('Settings').first().json.website).split('/')[2].replace(/^www\\./, '') }}-{{ $('Settings').first().json.section }}-elementor.json"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Run": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Turn the section into Elementor",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Turn the section into Elementor": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save the template",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}